{"4087530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Breaking Armor", "steam_appid": 4087530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Wasteland</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate a <strong>super-heavy tank</strong> alone through the remnants of a ruined world. Discover hidden secrets and face dangers at every turn. <i>You are protected by <strong>140 tons of steel</strong>, but will it be enough?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/d85f32be70ce39a20d60eaa1d8010c54.avif?t=1787430579\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras_big/d85f32be70ce39a20d60eaa1d8010c54.webp?t=1787430579 width=1560 height=132 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Tank</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/90d2a45526352017db4a29918c25a87d.poster.avif?t=1787430579\" width=796 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/90d2a45526352017db4a29918c25a87d.webm?t=1787430579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/90d2a45526352017db4a29918c25a87d.mp4?t=1787430579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between missions, return to your <strong>bunker</strong> to refuel, add oxygen, and enhance your tank’s systems. Upgrade your machine to extend your reach into the <strong>unknown</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steel and Fire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/bf252b76f348d9a16fd4ec7fd538f3ea.poster.avif?t=1787430579\" width=796 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/bf252b76f348d9a16fd4ec7fd538f3ea.webm?t=1787430579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/bf252b76f348d9a16fd4ec7fd538f3ea.mp4?t=1787430579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage <strong>enemy tanks</strong> and <strong>alien creatures</strong> with your powerful <strong>128 mm</strong> cannon and a secondary <strong>75 mm</strong> gun. Every shot counts, and a single mistake can turn <i>triumph</i> into <i>ruin</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prepare for the Next Expedition</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/2ee1c85ca2cd8559fbcab7f8cb9fce0f.poster.avif?t=1787430579\" width=796 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/2ee1c85ca2cd8559fbcab7f8cb9fce0f.webm?t=1787430579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/2ee1c85ca2cd8559fbcab7f8cb9fce0f.mp4?t=1787430579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your tank with <strong>additional modules</strong> to boost performance and handle new challenges. Adapt your machine and get ready for the <strong>dangers ahead</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Personal Touch</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/463b2b0c793bf38f80a2037642f26e25.poster.avif?t=1787430579\" width=796 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/463b2b0c793bf38f80a2037642f26e25.webm?t=1787430579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/463b2b0c793bf38f80a2037642f26e25.mp4?t=1787430579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate the inside of your <strong>E-100</strong> with small items to make it feel like <i>your</i> space. A familiar object can keep your morale steady out there.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmospheric Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a tense, atmospheric world with lowpoly, stylized visuals. <i><strong>Breaking Armor</strong></i> combines horror, tactical tank combat, and the eerie uncertainty of a planet reshaped by <strong>catastrophe</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/084dfde0713db86cea576ea24b75bf0f.avif?t=1787430579\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras_big/084dfde0713db86cea576ea24b75bf0f.webp?t=1787430579 width=1560 height=362 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Wasteland</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate a <strong>super-heavy tank</strong> alone through the remnants of a ruined world. Discover hidden secrets and face dangers at every turn. <i>You are protected by <strong>140 tons of steel</strong>, but will it be enough?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/d85f32be70ce39a20d60eaa1d8010c54.avif?t=1787430579\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras_big/d85f32be70ce39a20d60eaa1d8010c54.webp?t=1787430579 width=1560 height=132 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Tank</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/90d2a45526352017db4a29918c25a87d.poster.avif?t=1787430579\" width=796 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/90d2a45526352017db4a29918c25a87d.webm?t=1787430579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/90d2a45526352017db4a29918c25a87d.mp4?t=1787430579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between missions, return to your <strong>bunker</strong> to refuel, add oxygen, and enhance your tank’s systems. Upgrade your machine to extend your reach into the <strong>unknown</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steel and Fire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/bf252b76f348d9a16fd4ec7fd538f3ea.poster.avif?t=1787430579\" width=796 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/bf252b76f348d9a16fd4ec7fd538f3ea.webm?t=1787430579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/bf252b76f348d9a16fd4ec7fd538f3ea.mp4?t=1787430579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage <strong>enemy tanks</strong> and <strong>alien creatures</strong> with your powerful <strong>128 mm</strong> cannon and a secondary <strong>75 mm</strong> gun. Every shot counts, and a single mistake can turn <i>triumph</i> into <i>ruin</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prepare for the Next Expedition</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/2ee1c85ca2cd8559fbcab7f8cb9fce0f.poster.avif?t=1787430579\" width=796 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/2ee1c85ca2cd8559fbcab7f8cb9fce0f.webm?t=1787430579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/2ee1c85ca2cd8559fbcab7f8cb9fce0f.mp4?t=1787430579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your tank with <strong>additional modules</strong> to boost performance and handle new challenges. Adapt your machine and get ready for the <strong>dangers ahead</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Personal Touch</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/463b2b0c793bf38f80a2037642f26e25.poster.avif?t=1787430579\" width=796 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/463b2b0c793bf38f80a2037642f26e25.webm?t=1787430579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/463b2b0c793bf38f80a2037642f26e25.mp4?t=1787430579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate the inside of your <strong>E-100</strong> with small items to make it feel like <i>your</i> space. A familiar object can keep your morale steady out there.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmospheric Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a tense, atmospheri